<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria's Dunlop 1996 Q3 profits lower.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's Dunlop 1996 Q3 profits lower.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third-quarter result for tyre maker Dunlop Nigeria Plc to end-September.</p>
<p>(In million naira)</p>
<p>				 1996		1995</p>
<p> Turnover		   2,600	     2,300</p>
<p> Profit before taxation   312		 407</p>
<p> Taxation			93		 142</p>
<p> Profit after taxation    218		 264</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 263 03 17</p>
</text>
